                f"(got CS width={effective_concept_dim}, "
                f"WS event width={symbol_dim}). Fix: set <WholeSpace><nDim> "
                f"to match <ConceptualSpace><nOutputDim> if present, else "
                f"<ConceptualSpace><nDim>."
